    "extraction": {
      "id": "cvpr26-489eb835cac1",
      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2. Overall framework of our proposed BPFedCTTA. The top section illustrates the server-side process, where the global model is continually updated via Uncertainty-Gated Single-client Aggregation (UGSA) based on client-reported uncertainty. The bottom section depicts the client-side Bayesian Prior-guided Adaptation (BPA) module, which leverages the global model as a prior to perform stable local test-time adaptation via Maximum a Posteriori estimation, using only unlabeled test data.",
