      "figure": "Figure 4",
      "caption": "Figure 4. Overview of our Sky-VLM. Sky-VLM adopts a two-stage training approach. In the first stage, we involve supervised fine- tuning (SFT) on the entire SpatialSky-Dataset to develop the basic spatial reasoning capabilities. In the second stage, we use reinforcement fine-tuning (RFT), utilizing task-specific reward functions to enhance decision-making accuracy for key spatial tasks.",
