      "figure": "Figure 4",
      "caption": "Figure 4. Overview of the proposed methods. (a) Text-Attr enriches feature representations using semantic cues from images, com- pensating for missing labels and capturing shared attributes across levels. (b) Taxon-SSL handles missing-level labels by treating them as unlabeled and learns from visual consistency through augmented views. Both methods offer distinct benefits for our challenging task.",
