      "caption": "Figure 1. (a) An overview of the MCToGene framework. H&E WSIs are split into spot patches with coordinates; patch features are used to predict spot-level gene expression. (b) On a sparsiï¬ed spot graph, pairwise attention aggregates neighbors and a Readout summarizes local context; many-body attention models high-order cross-cell interactions. A ï¬‚ow-matching decoder reï¬nes predictions over timesteps.",
